{"id":879834,"title":"15｜创建GPU服务器","content":"本节课介绍了企业级私有化部署的方法，特别针对开发人员和产品经理在内网服务器上部署模型及Dify的需求。首先，在Linux环境下进行部署前，需选择一个成本效益高的算力市场租赁带GPU的服务器。以幕僚平台为例，用户只需充值约20元人民币即可按需租用配备英伟达4090显卡的服务器，该配置支持至少50G的数据盘空间，并可根据需要扩容至200G或更多，费用大约为两元每小时。选定conda版本11.8后，通过点击创建服务器快速完成设置。一旦服务器状态显示为“运行中”，即表明已成功建立，此时可通过JupyterLab远程连接到这台Linux服务器，开始进一步的配置工作。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":400754,"user_name":"Roway","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1060967,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"65AF589142AB6C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/30/67/a1e9aaba.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1749344213,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":5,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"私有化部署到内网，怎么还买外网的服务器呢？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1484127,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/a5/5f/65ca0544.jpg","nickname":"浮生","note":"","ucode":"8406F5583D7409","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":669916,"discussion_content":"私有化部署和外网服务器没啥关系，数据都在自己企业不在外部企业","content_length":30,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1755528485,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}